4. 上游规格说明 / Upstream Specification Notice

   本项目为独立重写（"C 方案：只借规格重制"）。仓库中不包含任何上游项目的源代码，
   仅参考了 fb-labs/ZhiBiao 与 FB208/OpenBidKit_Yibiao 的领域规格（字段口径、核对规则、
   章节骨架），并以 YAML 规则包形式重新表达。上述上游项目采用 AGPL-3.0 许可；若未来
   引入其源代码，必须重新评估 AGPL-3.0 的归属与 §13 网络交互义务。

   This project is an independent reimplementation. No upstream source code is included;
   only domain specifications (field definitions, check rules, chapter skeletons) from
   fb-labs/ZhiBiao and FB208/OpenBidKit_Yibiao were referenced and re-expressed as YAML
   rule packages. Those upstream projects are licensed under AGPL-3.0. Introducing their
   source code in the future requires a fresh review of AGPL-3.0 attribution and §13
   network-use obligations.

